// Songle SRD-05VDC-SL-C, the high-sensitivity (L) form C (C) 5 V coil.
// The contact follows the coil current. At DC that current is the coil voltage over 70 ohm,
// so the thresholds are the sheet's must-operate and must-release voltages.
